@startuml
title Hybrid Encryption API Flow - Send Encrypted Private Key

actor Client
participant Server

Client -> Server: Send RSA Public Key

note right of Server
1. Generate AES symmetric key
2. Generate or load RSA Private Key
3. Encrypt Private Key with AES key
4. Encrypt AES key with Client's RSA Public Key
end note

Server -> Client: Return Encrypted Private Key\nand Encrypted AES Key
note left of Client
Client can now:
1. Decrypt AES key using its RSA Private Key
2. Decrypt Private Key using AES key
end note
@enduml
